Note (PS2-G30-3, not fixed): with the Makefile generator, the custom commands of a generated source listed
in several targets (the *_src custom target and the test executables) are emitted in each target's
build.make ($W/cm/src/check/CMakeFiles/{test_scotch_mesh_build_f,test_scotch_mesh_build_f.f90_src}.dir/build.make
both contain the cmake_sed rule, pristine and patched); a toy project ($W/cmdup) shows add_dependencies()
does not change that. Pre-existing; benign unless "make -j" runs both copies at the same instant.
